      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثَقَّفٌ</span></b>  A spear <i>straightened,</i> or <i>made even.</i>
(TA.) [Accord. to Freytag, it is poetically used
as signifying <i>A spear</i> itself; and so with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>.]

